Voxora Copilot Context — Landing Page

CORE GOAL
The user must understand Voxora in under 5 seconds.

If they only read the headline and subheadline, they should immediately understand:
Voxora is a real-time customer support chat tool with AI help.

PRODUCT DEFINITION
Voxora helps businesses:

* Chat with customers in real time
* Manage support conversations in one place
* Reply faster with AI assistance

Do not add anything beyond this. Keep it simple and clear.

DO NOT INCLUDE

* Voice features
* Technical architecture
* Complex explanations
* Buzzwords

HERO SECTION RULES
The headline must clearly say what the product does.

Good headline examples:

* Customer support, in real time
* Chat with your customers. Reply faster with AI
* Simple, real-time customer support

Subheadline should slightly expand:

* Talk to your customers instantly and manage conversations in one place
* Handle customer chats in real time with simple tools and AI assistance

CTA BUTTONS

* Get Started
* View on GitHub

5-SECOND TEST
If a user reads only the hero section, they must understand:

* This is for customer support
* It involves chat
* It is real-time
* AI helps (optional but clear)

If not, rewrite.

FEATURES SECTION
Keep it minimal. Maximum 4 features.

Examples:
Real-time chat
Talk to customers instantly

AI assistance
Get help replying faster

Shared inbox
Manage all conversations in one place

Simple interface
Clean and easy to use

HOW IT WORKS
Keep it very simple:

1. Customer sends a message
2. You see it instantly
3. AI suggests a reply
4. You respond

WHY VOXORA
Focus on outcomes only:

* Faster replies
* Less manual work
* Better support experience
* Easy to use

DESIGN DIRECTION

* Dark theme
* Clean layout
* Large readable text
* Lots of spacing

COPY STYLE RULES

* Short sentences
* Simple words
* No jargon
* No fluff

FINAL RULE
If the user has to think to understand Voxora, the content is wrong.
